## 6. Phase 4: ML 預測 (alpha 29-30)

### ALPHA-29 LightGBM 特徵預測
```python
def alpha_29(code, lookahead=6, train_ratio=0.7):
    """特徵: RSI/MACD/volume_z/return_lag/order_imbalance.
    Label: 未來 6 bar (30min) return > 0?
    LightGBM 分類, CPU 訓練 (快)."""
```

### ALPHA-30 LSTM 序列預測 (GPU)
```python
def alpha_30(code, seq_len=48, hidden=64, epochs=50):
    """PyTorch LSTM, 輸入過去 48 bar (1日) → 預測下 6 bar 方向.
    GPU 訓練 (用你個 GPU).
    early stopping 防 overfit.
    蒙地卡羅驗證."""
```

### 防過擬合
- train/test 70/30 split + walk-forward
- early stopping (patience=10)
- 蒙地卡羅 p-value (<0.05 先用)
- feature importance 檢查 (唔好靠單一特徵)

